<title>HONG KONG: Varitronix interim net rises slightly.</title>
<headline>Varitronix interim net rises slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   40.08     vs 39.80</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    15.0	vs 9.5</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  5.83 gain vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    111.84    vs 106.45</p>
<p>    Turnover		     329.62    vs 328.61</p>
<p>    Company name		 Varitronix International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  October 7-11</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 18</p>
<p>NOTE - Varitronix International is a liquid crystal display manufacturer and designer.</p>
<p>Net is after an exceptional gain on write back of provision for investments.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
